#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""da-models - DriverAgent model registry client.

The model binaries are in a private GCS bucket. This repository holds the
manifest (models.yaml), this tool and the documents. See README.md.

Commands:
  list                          show the models and versions in models.yaml
  pull  <model>[@version]       download, check sha256, move into place
  build <model>[@version]       get or build the engines for this device
  verify [<model>[@version]]    check the local store (and the bucket)
  publish <spec.yaml>           upload a new immutable version
  cache-put <model>@<version> <component> <engine>
                                put an engine built on this device in the cache
  device                        show the device identity and engine tags
"""

